// The secrets device told there is no keyring (ENT_SECRETS=none), on
// every system: nothing is kept, nothing read. (Tests do not see the
// user's keyring: secrets_keyring.test does, where asked for.)
// RUN: %ent build %S/Inputs/secrets_kept.ent -o %t.program
// RUN: env ENT_SECRETS=none %t.program | FileCheck %s

// CHECK:      available false
// CHECK-NEXT: kept false [] other []
// CHECK-NEXT: again false [] forgotten false []
